<title>USA: Schering-Plough Corp Q2 net income up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Schering-Plough Corp Q2 net income up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, N.J. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.51		    $0.43</p>
<p> Net			373,100		  317,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,719,800		1,476,600</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 revenues up 16 percent, Q2 net income up 18 pct.</p>
<p>Foreign exchange, reflecting a stronger U.S. dollar versus most major currencies, had a negative effect of about 3 percentage points on the quarter's increase in sales.</p>
<p>		    6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.02		    $0.88</p>
<p> Net			748,400		  643,700</p>
<p> Revs		   3,287,900		2,869,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 731,700		  714,600</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Certain 1996 amounts restated for 2-for-1 stock split.</p>
</text>
